rael heard about it. Jacob had twelve sons:","from":13},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Naphtali: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, and Shillem.","from":13},{"book":"GEN","chapter":46,"verse":25,"verseEnd":25,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These are the sons of Jacob born to Bilhah, whom Laban gave to his daughter Rachel—seven in all.","from":13},{"book":"GEN","chapter":50,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"He saw Ephraimʼs sons to the third generation, and indeed the sons of Machir son of Manasseh were brought up on Josephʼs knees.","from":14},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":29,"verseEnd":34,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the descendants of Manasseh: The Machirite clan from Machir, the father of Gilead, and the Gileadite clan from Gilead. These were the descendants of Gilead: the Iezerite clan from Iezer, the Helekite clan from Helek, the Asrielite clan from Asriel, the Shechemite clan from Shechem, the Shemidaite clan from Shemida, and the Hepherite clan from Hepher. Now Zelophehad son of Hepher had no sons but only daughters. The names of his daughters were Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah.","from":14},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":30,"verseEnd":30,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the descendants of Gilead: the Iezerite clan from Iezer, the Helekite clan from Helek,","from":18},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now Zelophehad son of Hepher had no sons but only daughters. The names of his daughters were Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milcah, and Tirzah.","from":15}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"20-29":{"people":[{"id":"ephraim-h0669g","name":"Ephraim","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":2,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"bered-h1260h","name":"Bered","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Shuthelah","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"eleadah-h0497","nam