":"בֵּית שְׁאָן","tr":"bet she·an","gloss":"Beth-shean","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":18},{"base":"H1032","lemma":"בֵּית חוֹרֹן","tr":"bet cho·ron","gloss":"Beth-horon","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":28},{"base":"H1008","lemma":"בֵּֽיתְ־אֵל","tr":"bet-el","gloss":"Bethel","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":142},{"base":"H0669","lemma":"אֶפְרַ֫יִם","tr":"eph·ra·yim","gloss":"Ephraim","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":180},{"base":"H1260","lemma":"בֶּ֫רֶד","tr":"be·red","gloss":"Bered","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H8465","lemma":"תַּ֫חַן","tr":"ta·chan","gloss":"Tahan","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"GEN","chapter":28,"verse":19,"verseEnd":19,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and he called that place Bethel, though previously the city had been named Luz.","from":28},{"book":"GEN","chapter":35,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And with her last breath—for she was dying—she named him Ben-oni. But his father called him Benjamin.","from":23},{"book":"GEN","chapter":37,"verse":34,"verseEnd":34,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then Jacob tore his clothes, put sackcloth around his waist, and mourned for his son many days.","from":22},{"book":"EXO","chapter":17,"verse":9,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Moses said to Joshua, “Choose some of our men and go out to fight the Amalekites. Tomorrow I will stand on the hilltop with the staff of God in my hand.” Joshua did as Moses had instructed him and fought against the Amalekites, while Moses, Aaron, and Hur went up to the top of the hill. As long as Moses held up his hands, Israel prevailed; but when he lowered them, Amalek prevailed. When Mosesʼ hands grew heavy, they took a stone and put it under him, and he sat on it. Then Aaron and Hur held his hands up, one on each side, so that his hands remained steady until the sun went down. So Joshua overwhelmed Amalek and his army with the sword.","from":27},{"book":"EXO","chapter":24,"verse":13,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So Moses set out with Joshua his attendant and went up on the mountain of God.","from":27},{"book":"EXO","chapter":32,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"When Joshua heard the sound of the people shouting, he said to Moses, “The sound of war is in the camp.”","from":27},{"book":"NUM","chapter":11,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Joshua son of Nun, the attendant to Moses since youth, spoke up and said, “Moses, my lord, stop them!”","from":27},{"book":"NUM","chapter":13,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"from the tribe of Ephraim, Hoshea son of Nun;","from":27}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2},{"id":"exodus-family","title":"Moses and his circle","people":2}]},"30-40":{"people":[{"id":"asher-h0836","name":"Asher","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"beriah-h1283g","name":"Beriah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Asher","count":2,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"ishvah-h3438","name":"Ishvah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Asher","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"ishvi-h3440g","name":"Ishvi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Asher","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"serah-h8294","name":"Serah","kind":"person","brief":"Sister of Imnah","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"heber-h2268g","name":"Heber","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":2,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"birzaith-h1269","name":"Birzaith","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Malchiel","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"malchiel-h4439","name":"Malchiel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Beriah","count":1,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"hotham-h2369g","name":"Hotham","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Heber","count":2,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"japhlet-h3310","name":"Japhlet","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Heber","count":2,"firstVerse":32},{"id":"shomer-h7763h","name":"Shomer","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Heber","count":2,"firstVer